---
title: AdviseCare - State Machine - Correction Request
---

stateDiagram-v2
    direction LR
    [*] --> pending : student reports a wrong value under a consent purpose (no case needed)
    pending --> approved : first advisor of the pool approves (new correction row, same valid-from)
    pending --> rejected : first advisor of the pool rejects with a note
    pending --> withdrawn : student withdraws
    approved --> [*]
    rejected --> [*]
    withdrawn --> [*]
